The game will be available in two new languages very soon.

( https://albiononline.com/news/arabic-turkish-coming )

Adventurer,

We=E2=80=99re excited to announce that in the coming weeks Albion Online wi=
ll be launched in two new languages: *Turkish* and *Arabic* ! Players will =
be able to log in and play the game entirely in these two languages with bo=
th existing and new characters, on each server, and will also have access t=
o language-specific *in-game chat* channels and dedicated *subforums*. The =
game will also feature *right-to-left support* when playing in Arabic.

Introducing Turkish and Arabic will be an ongoing process, particularly giv=
en the challenges of introducing a right-to-left display, and we will conti=
nue to optimize them after release. Our website will be available in these =
languages soon, with important news and information translated to keep you =
up-to-date. We look forward to hearing your feedback, and stay tuned for mo=
re on this exciting development soon!

( https://albiononline.com/shop/featured )

Last Chance to get the Panda Starter Bundle
-------------------------------------------

The *Albion Online Lunar New Year Sale* is coming to an end, and it's your =
last chance to get the coveted *Panda* Direbear skin in an exclusive *Start=
er Bundle* !

You can pick this bundle up in the web shop or ingame store in the Native c=
lient until *10:00 UTC on February 25* , which includes the following:

* *Panda Direbear Skin*
* *90 Days Premium Status*
* *500 Gold*

Once owned, the Panda will be unlocked on both servers. This is a rare chan=
ce to own one of Albion's most popular mounts, so don't miss out!

